    - rid: 6341373060195811397
      type: {class: MulticTag, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        lines:
        - text:
            en: I'M SURE ONE HUNDRED OUT OF A HUNDRED
            ru: "\u042F \u0423\u0412\u0415\u0420\u0415\u041D \u0421\u0422\u041E \u0418\u0417
              \u0421\u0422\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b38385e122939194fbeeab7b99a81847, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: I ENDURED EVERYTHING FOR A REASON
            ru: "\u042F \u0422\u0415\u0420\u041F\u0415\u041B \u0412\u0421\u0401 \u041D\u0415\u0421\u041F\u0420\u041E\u0421\u0422\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f6d52afba50e1d49ad37757098ae148, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: ANGER IS BREWING LIKE A CYST
            ru: "\u0417\u041B\u041E\u0411\u0410 \u0417\u0420\u0415\u0415\u0422 \u041A\u0410\u041A
              \u041A\u0418\u0421\u0422\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 56cf2e8cc761401419da5a305c527c53, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: MY SOUL IS FILLED WITH EMPTINESS
            ru: "\u0421 \u0414\u0423\u0428\u0415 \u041F\u041E\u041B\u041D\u0418\u0422\u0421\u042F
              \u041F\u0423\u0421\u0422\u041E\u0422\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963d349b310feae4e9867ad46b9c18e6, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: YOU ARE INNOCENT AND PURE
            ru: "\u0422\u042B \u041D\u0415\u0412\u0418\u041D\u041D\u0410 \u0418 \u0427\u0418\u0421\u0422\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 178d13a3d4927c7448c83b7aa68d43b8, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: AND YOU HAVE A SCYTHE IN YOUR HANDS
            ru: "\u0418 \u0412 \u0422\u0412\u041E\u0418\u0425 \u0420\u0423\u041A\u0410\u0425
              \u041A\u041E\u0421\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c5d07a9d263e63d49969709358633484, type: 3}
        - text:
            en: THE WIND BLOWS IN THE SAI-I-I-I-I-I-ILS
            ru: "\u0412\u0415\u0422\u0415\u0420 \u0414\u0423\u0415\u0422 \u0412 \u041F\u0410\u0420\u0423\u0421\u0410-\u0410-\u0410-\u0410-\u0410-\u0410"
          sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ddc14d55d5796594ba4241f1502e4b05, type: 3}
